Description: Tools for finding, downloading, reading, visualizing, sampling,
  modeling, and processing NASA Global Ecosystem Dynamics Investigation
  (GEDI) Level 1B, Level 2A, Level 2B, Level 3, Level 4A, and Level 4B data.
  Supports local files, NASA Earthdata Cloud access, and optional Google Earth
  Engine workflows for ancillary-data extraction and wall-to-wall mapping.
